{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026b4JmkaPP9I1794390976.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>李嘉誠基金會向中大醫院、港怡醫院及養和醫院提供30個臨床試驗名額，以組織碎化技術治療腎癌。</p><p></p><p>基金會早前向港大醫學院、中大醫學院及養和醫院，捐贈以聲波擊碎腫瘤的「組織碎化技術」儀器，治療肝腫瘤及胰臟癌，並在過去兩年治療超過400人。最新擴展至腎癌治療令香港成為亞洲首個臨床試驗以「組織碎化技術」，治療腎癌患者的城市。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MEDICAL-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bs5RitujBh1794400452.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>港大醫學院前年獲贈相關儀器後，一度在瑪麗醫院臨床試驗，其後將儀器轉移至港怡醫院。</p><p></p><p>有意見質疑為何儀器未納入公營醫療，當局曾指應用創新藥械有嚴格既定機制，考慮過程不受是否有捐助左右。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:58:20.938211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:43:18.139820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:51:42.946671+00:00","content_hash":"7652e05d049b07156c634171364e2ba7b54c855631fab5b4480ba38b11d9d287","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:58:20.938211+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}